Package: libgrpc-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libabsl-dev (= ${binary:Version}), libgrpc (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: High performance, open source, general RPC framework - development files
 gRPC is a modern, open source, high-performance remote procedure call (RPC)
 framework that can run anywhere.  This package contains the header files and
 static libraries.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the static library for libgrpc.

